{
  "slug": "codebase-visualizer",
  "name": "Codebase Visualizer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Transform any codebase into an interactive visual HTML guide with animated architecture diagrams, story-mode narrative, data flow animations, and bilingual CN/EN support. Generates a single self-contained HTML file that a 10-year-old can understand.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `codebase-visualizer` (Transform any codebase into an interactive visual HTML guide that a 10-year-old can understand).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codebase-visualizer@claude-community` from `belugatempo-dot/codebase-visualizer`.\n\nA Claude Code skill that transforms any codebase into an interactive, single-file HTML guide with a starry night theme.",
